* ''The R0 / REGION coordination seam'' — the Codex crew holds R0's DESIGN (their B6/C2) but R0's reds live in `open-node-vessel.ts` (founding boot ground); whichever hearth builds it CROSSES — name the crossing before a hand starts.
* ''`dist/` is STALE against ③ + ⑤ + native-parity source'' (2026-09-18) — the ③ spirit deferred `pnpm -r build` (a sibling e2e held dist live). Run `pnpm -r build` (mesh→tw5→node) before any e2e or live daemon boot against these changes; do NOT rebuild while an e2e spirit runs (it shares dist).

